<title>USA: AMEX to list Data Dimensions options.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Data Dimensions options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said it will list options on Data Dimensions Inc shares on March 31.</p>
<p>The options will have initial strike prices of 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2, with expirations in April, May, August and November. Position limit is 10,500 contracts.</p>
<p>LETCO-Specialist LP will be the specialist unit on the AMEX floor, the exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
